s, poets, and vocalists. It bridges the gap between a distraction-free writing environment and a powerful linguistic analysis tool, allowing creators to find perfect rhymes, count syllables, and manage multiple projects simultaneously without ever breaking their creative flow."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-display uppercase text-foreground mt-8 mb-4","children":"Core Editor Features"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"At the heart of RymeHelper is a robust, rich-text editor powered by Tiptap/ProseMirror. It includes standard formatting tools as well as custom extensions tailored for songwriting."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Rich Text Formatting:"}]," Standard support for bold, italic, underline, strikethrough, highlighting, and text alignment."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Syllable Counter:"}]," Automatically calculates and displays syllable counts for lines, helping you maintain consistent rhythm and meter."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Auto-Rhyme Highlighter:"}]," Intelligently highlights words at the end of lines that rhyme, giving you a visual representation of your rhyme scheme."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Line Manipulation:"}]," Dedicated tools for shifting, rearranging, and formatting stanzas and verses efficiently."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Auto-Scroll:"}]," A built-in teleprompter feature that smoothly scrolls your lyrics during recording or practice sessions. The speed can be adjusted via the footer interface."]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-display uppercase text-foreground mt-8 mb-4","children":"Rhyming & Dictionary Tools"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"RymeHelper integrates seamlessly with linguistic databases (via the Datamuse API) to provide instant lyrical inspiration directly within the editor."}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10"]}],"$L11"]}],["$L12"],"$L13"]}],"isPartial":"$@14","staleTime":"$15","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L16","isPartial":"$@17","staleTime":"$15","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L18","isPartial":"$@19","staleTime":"$15","varyParams":"$1a"},{"rsc":"$L1b","isPartial":"$@1c","staleTime":"$15","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@1d","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@1e"}
